      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to the airport for your flight to Puerto Natales.\n\nOn arrival, we'll meet you and take you to the Altiplanico Natales Hotel.\n\nThe rest of the day is free."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_label:f1f6ee1063fb857a",
